WEBVTT

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:31.222
and I wondered if I go where the light is,

00:01:31.246 --> 00:01:34.868
I might be able to find a bowl of rice.

00:01:36.702 --> 00:01:40.340
It's not like we had a grand plan or maps.

00:01:40.364 --> 00:01:43.855
We did not know anything
about what was going to happen.

00:01:45.052 --> 00:01:48.096
Imagine your apartment
building caught fire.

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:50.843
I mean, what would you do?

00:01:50.867 --> 00:01:53.449
Would you stay there to be burned,

00:01:53.473 --> 00:01:55.843
or would you jump off out of the window

00:01:55.867 --> 00:01:57.451
and see what happens?

00:01:57.966 --> 00:01:59.398
That's what we did.

00:01:59.422 --> 00:02:02.280
We jumped out of the house